--- a call handed a failure made in its argument (`encode[error['why']]`)
--- answers that failure, as any call handed a failed value does: compiled,
--- the failure's value of no kind had been handed on where the row takes a
--- value, and the program did not build (Rosetta Code, JSON pointer)

fn shout[t]
    return upper[t]

log[encode[error['why']]]
log[str[error['why']]]
log[shout[error['loud']].reason]
x = len[error['n']]
log[x.ok]
